3. STRICT COMPLIANCE

Any distribution, modification, propagation, or network use of VULTURE must comply with every applicable requirement of the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

In particular, where applicable, a distributor of a modified version must:

1. identify modifications;
2. preserve required copyright notices;
3. preserve required license notices;
4. provide the applicable license;
5. provide the Corresponding Source as required;
6. provide required installation information where applicable;
7. preserve required legal notices;
8. comply with the AGPL requirements applicable to network interaction; and
9. refrain from imposing further restrictions on recipients.

