Commercial use is permitted only under the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

Commercial users remain fully responsible for compliance with the license.

Commercial use does not grant ownership of VULTURE.

Commercial use does not transfer copyright.

Commercial use does not grant ownership of the VULTURE project, repository, documentation, original implementation, or VULTURE Marks.

Commercial users must comply with all applicable source-disclosure and network-use obligations imposed by the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

