6. COMMERCIAL DISTRIBUTION

A person may sell copies of VULTURE where permitted by the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

However, payment for a copy does not create ownership of the underlying copyright.

A commercial distributor must provide recipients all rights and materials required by the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

A distributor may not sell VULTURE while simultaneously removing the freedoms granted by the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

