10. FORKS

Forks are permitted under the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

A fork does not acquire ownership of the original VULTURE project.

A fork does not acquire ownership of black-210's original copyrighted material.

A fork must comply with the AGPL-3.0-or-later.

A fork must accurately identify itself as a fork or derivative where necessary to prevent confusion.

